="01:18.930" end="01:19.260">wanna </span><span begin="01:19.260" end="01:20.310">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.340" end="01:22.950"><span begin="01:20.340" end="01:20.670">Like </span><span begin="01:20.670" end="01:20.820">I'm </span><span begin="01:20.820" end="01:21.180">close </span><span begin="01:21.180" end="01:21.300">to </span><span begin="01:21.300" end="01:22.110">something </span><span begin="01:22.110" end="01:22.950">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.160" end="01:27.990"><span begin="01:23.160" end="01:23.370">I </span><span begin="01:23.370" end="01:23.700">wanna </span><span begin="01:23.700" end="01:24.120">find </span><span begin="01:24.120" end="01:24.930">something </span><span begin="01:24.930" end="01:25.110">I've </span><span begin="01:25.110" end="01:25.860">wanted </span><span begin="01:25.860" end="01:26.250">all </span><span begin="01:26.250" end="01:27.990">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.020" end="01:30.750"><span begin="01:28.020" end="01:28.890">Somewhere </span><span begin="01:28.890" end="01:29.310">I </span><span begin="01:29.310" end="01:30.750">belong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.750" end="01:32.160"><span begin="01:30.750" end="01:30.870">And </span><span begin="01:30.870" end="01:31.020">I've </span><span begin="01:31.020" end="01:31.170">got </span><span begin="01:31.170" end="01:31.560">nothing </span><span begin="01:31.560" end="01:31.650">to </span><span begin="01:31.650" end="01:32.160">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.160" end="01:35.250"><span begin="01:32.160" end="01:32.250">I </span><span begin="01:32.250" end="01:32.520">can't </span><span begin="01:32.520" end="01:32.910">believe </span><span begin="01:32.910" end="01:33.030">I </span><span begin="01:33.030" end="01:33.330">didn't </span><span begin="01:33.330" end="01:33.750">fall </span><span begin="01:33.750" end="01:34.110">right </span><span begin="01:34.110" end="01:34.410">down </span><span be